@host = http://localhost:5080

### Crear ingreso BOB
POST {{host}}/api/v1/incomes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 5000,
  "description": "Sueldo diciembre",
  "receivedDate": "2025-12-01",
  "source": "Sueldo",
  "currency": "BOB"
}

### Historial
GET {{host}}/api/v1/incomes

### Consultar ingreso existente (reemplazar el GUID)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/incomes/82ab4f7c-32cd-4e3a-9f49-f73701ce7230

### GUID válido no registrado: debe responder 404 con mensaje
GET {{host}}/api/v1/incomes/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### Identificador mal formado: debe responder 400
GET {{host}}/api/v1/incomes/id-invalido

### Tipo de cambio
GET {{host}}/api/v1/exchange-rates/USD/BOB

### Balance consolidado
GET {{host}}/api/v1/balances?from=2025-12-01&to=2025-12-31&currency=BOB

### Moneda inválida: debe responder 400
POST {{host}}/api/v1/incomes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 100,
  "description": "Ingreso en euros",
  "receivedDate": "2025-12-01",
  "source": "Venta",
  "currency": "EUR"
}
